  "name": "Jungle Curry Paste - SD Books",
  "text": "Jungle Curry Paste - SD Books\n\nYield: 1 cup\n\nPreparation time:\n\nCooking time:\n\nIngredients\n\n5 dried spur chilies (seeded and soaked until tender),\n\n30 g dried hot chilies,\n\n20 fresh hot chillies (assorted colours),\n\n1 tsp sea salt,\n\n1½ tbsp mature galangal (finely sliced),\n\n3 stalks lemongrass (sliced),\n\n2 tsp kaffir lime rind (finely sliced),\n\n60 g small garlic (peeled),\n\n¼ cup shallot (sliced),\n\n1 tsp black peppercorns,\n\n1 tbsp shrimp paste.\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Process to a smooth paste.",
  "recipeYield": "1 cup",
